<title>USA: CCC buys 16,910 tonnes US HRW wheat for Mozambique.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 16,910 tonnes US HRW wheat for Mozambique.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said on Thursday it had purchased 16,910 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for export to Mozambique</p>
<p>The wheat was bought from Farmland Industries for $183.34 per tonne, FOB Galveston.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for December 5-31.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
